Z||000000||Raydar||01-28-2001||09:51 PM||||To anyone in the Ga Fieros or anyone considering attending a club meeting...<BR>The meeting day has been changed to the 2nd Saturday of each month. We ended up missing too many meetings in a row, due to Thanksgiving and Christmas/New Years holidays falling at the end of the month. The next meeting should be held on the 2nd Saturday of March. Same location... American Pie on Roswell Rd. 1:30 PM.<BR>The website will probably be updated shortly, in order to reflect this change. (Thanks, Donald.)<P>Was happy to meet some more Forum members (Predator [Donald] and Ronnie from Athens) this weekend. Glad you all could make it.<BR>Was great to see all the other folks that I haven't seen for a while. MrPBody, 88 Database Guy, LemonSky, Paul the FieroSails guy, and all the others.<P>And Ronnie... Sorry I don't recall your wife's name, but I told Tammy (my wife) that she said to bring our wives, next time.<BR>Tammy's reply: "That car hates me!" The one and only time that she ever tried to drive it, it stalled on her as she pulled out of the garage, and she couldn't get it to restart. (Hasn't misbehaved since.) She let it roll back into the garage, kicked the tires a couple of times, and drove my truck, with the dead A.C., instead. <BR>Maybe someday...<BR><P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe||||reg||4
Z||000001||Ronnie||01-28-2001||10:14 PM||||Hey Raydar!! Nice report. I  (we) really enjoyed the meeting yesterday! Was neat to meet some of you guys from the Forum too. I just can't put everybodies face with the Forum names,lol.My wifes name is Carolyn, she enjoyed the meeting also.Can't remember everyones names, but the guy that works on Fieros, (Don? maybe?), gave me some bushings and washers to install on my clutch pedal. I replaced my pedal with a new one that I already had along with the bushings, and it fixed my clutch-on-the-floor problem!!!Will see you next meeting hopefully.<P>------------------<BR>Black '86GT 4spd / Silver '87GT 5spd<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BOTHGTS_1.jpg"> ||||reg||6
Z||000002||Predator||01-29-2001||08:10 AM||||Hey guys, I really enjoyed meeting everybody Saturday, and I have started working on a new look for the site. I will post a site address for everybody to see if they like it before I post it live. I am still waiting to hear from Raymon on the information to update the current site with. I am going to try a redesign of the site if everybody does not mind. I thought if it is ok with Cliff that I would put a Forum link here so that everybody in the club will come here to use Cliff's Forum. I will ask Cliff's permission before I add the link. I hope to have it ready for review by the end of the week. I hope to have my car ready and at the next meeting. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Fiero4_1.jpg"> ||||reg||10
